{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't Mind the Robots</i> is a classic tower defense game in which you build a maze of towers to extend the path of enemy robots. Each new map presents a new challenge, requiring you to reevaluate your strategy and adapt to the approaching robots' strengths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656070/extras/13834d7e1ef200470f54acc6774b9922.poster.avif?t=1763209153\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656070/extras/13834d7e1ef200470f54acc6774b9922.webm?t=1763209153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656070/extras/13834d7e1ef200470f54acc6774b9922.mp4?t=1763209153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards and choose between numerous perks to improve your defense. Unlock new towers and build a deadly maze. Use support nodes, abilities, and aiming parameters to maximize the effectiveness of your setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you prevail against increasingly powerful waves of robots?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 different towers with 3 upgrade levels each</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ unique maps allowing several ways to victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 40 types of robots with individual strengths and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perk system grants numerous improvements for towers, economy and intelligence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your towers' impact by placing support nodes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\